---
import TopTierLegalLayout from '~/layouts/TopTierLegalLayout.astro';
import TopTierLegalNav from './_components/TopTierLegalNav.astro';
import TopTierLegalFooter from './_components/TopTierLegalFooter.astro';
---
<TopTierLegalLayout title="Privacy Policy — Top Tier Legal PLLC" description="Top Tier Legal PLLC Privacy Policy. How we collect, use, and protect your information.">
	<TopTierLegalNav />
	<main class="min-h-screen">
		<article class="border-b border-stone-200 bg-white px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24 lg:px-8">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl prose prose-stone">
				<h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 sm:text-4xl" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;">Top Tier Legal PLLC Privacy Policy</h1>
				<p class="mt-2 text-stone-500">Effective Date: 10/12/2025</p>

				<div class="mt-8 rounded-lg border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-4 text-sm text-amber-900">
					<strong>IMPORTANT NOTICE REGARDING TEXT MESSAGING DATA</strong><br />
					Top Tier Legal PLLC ("we," "us," or "our") DOES NOT share customer opt-in information, including phone numbers and consent records, with any affiliates or third parties for marketing, promotional, or any other purposes unrelated to providing our direct services. All text messaging originator opt-in data is kept strictly confidential.
				</div>

				<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-stone-600">We collect the following types of information:</p>
				<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-stone-800">Personal Information:</h3>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>Opt-in records and timestamps for all communication channels (SMS, email, etc.)</li>
					<li>Payment information when you make a purchase or request a quote</li>
					<li>Name, email address, phone number, physical address</li>
				</ul>
				<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-stone-800">Non-Personal Information:</h3>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>Cookies and similar technologies</li>
					<li>Website usage patterns and analytics</li>
					<li>IP address, browser type, device information</li>
				</ul>
				<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-stone-800">Customer Communication:</h3>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>Service history and feedback</li>
					<li>Appointment details and preferences</li>
					<li>Records of inquiries and service requests</li>
				</ul>

				<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-stone-600">We use collected data for:</p>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>Maintaining records of your communication preferences and consent</li>
					<li>Ensuring security and fraud prevention</li>
					<li>Enhancing website functionality and user experience</li>
					<li>Communicating with you about your inquiries, appointments, and promotions</li>
					<li>Processing transactions and payments</li>
					<li>Providing and improving our services</li>
				</ul>

				<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;">3. SMS Messaging & Compliance</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 font-medium text-stone-800">Text Message Program Terms & Conditions</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-stone-600">By opting into our SMS messaging services, you agree to receive text messages related to our services, including appointment reminders, customer support, and important updates.</p>
				<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-stone-800">Opt-In & Consent:</h3>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>We comply with the Telephone Consumer Protection Act (TCPA) and all applicable laws</li>
					<li>We maintain timestamped records of all opt-in actions</li>
					<li>You will only receive messages if you have explicitly opted in</li>
				</ul>
				<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-stone-800">Opt-Out Instructions:</h3>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>All opt-out requests are processed immediately</li>
					<li>You will receive a final confirmation message, and no further messages will be sent unless you re-opt in</li>
					<li>You can cancel SMS notifications at any time by replying "STOP"</li>
				</ul>
				<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-stone-800">Message Frequency & Content:</h3>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>We do not send promotional content without specific consent</li>
					<li>Messages will be directly related to the services you have requested</li>
					<li>Message frequency varies based on your interactions with our business</li>
				</ul>
				<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-stone-800">Help & Support:</h3>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>Customer support is available during regular business hours</li>
					<li>Reply "HELP" for assistance or contact us at clientcare@toptierlegalpllc.com</li>
				</ul>
				<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-stone-800">Carrier Information:</h3>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>Supported carriers include AT&T, Verizon, T-Mobile, Sprint, and most regional carriers</li>
					<li>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages</li>
					<li>Standard message and data rates may apply</li>
				</ul>

				<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;">4. Information Sharing & Disclosure</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-stone-600">We do not sell, rent, or trade personal information. We may share information with:</p>
				<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-stone-800">Service Providers:</h3>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>All service providers are contractually obligated to maintain confidentiality and security</li>
					<li>SMS aggregators and providers solely for the purpose of delivering messages you've consented to receive</li>
					<li>Third-party vendors who assist in our operations (e.g., payment processing, appointment scheduling)</li>
				</ul>
				<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-stone-800">Legal Compliance:</h3>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>In response to valid law enforcement requests or court orders</li>
					<li>If required by law, legal process, or to protect our rights</li>
				</ul>
				<h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-stone-800">Business Transfers:</h3>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>In such cases, your data remains protected under the terms of this policy</li>
					<li>In case of mergers, acquisitions, or sale of assets</li>
				</ul>

				<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;">5. Data Security</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-stone-600">We implement and maintain reasonable security measures to protect your personal information:</p>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>Secure backup systems and disaster recovery procedures</li>
					<li>Breach notification protocols in accordance with applicable laws</li>
					<li>Employee training on data protection</li>
					<li>Regular security assessments and updates</li>
					<li>Secure access controls and authentication mechanisms</li>
					<li>Encryption of sensitive data in transit and at rest</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="mt-4 text-stone-600">Despite these measures, no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure. We strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your personal information but cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

				<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;">6. Cookies & Tracking Technologies</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-stone-600">We use cookies and similar technologies to:</p>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>Measure the effectiveness of our services</li>
					<li>Improve website functionality and user experience</li>
					<li>Remember your preferences</li>
					<li>Analyze site traffic and user behavior</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="mt-4 text-stone-600">You may control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may limit your ability to use certain features of our website.</p>

				<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;">7. Your Rights & Choices</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-stone-600">You have the right to:</p>
				<ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-stone-600">
					<li>Lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority if you believe your rights have been violated</li>
					<li>Withdraw consent at any time for future communications</li>
					<li>Request information on how we process your data</li>
					<li>Opt-out of SMS messages by replying "STOP"</li>
					<li>Opt-out of marketing emails by clicking "unsubscribe" in our emails</li>
					<li>Access, update, or delete your personal information</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="mt-4 text-stone-600">To exercise these rights, please contact us using the information in Section 10.</p>

				<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;">8. Third-Party Links</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-stone-600">Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices and encourage you to review their policies. This privacy policy applies only to information collected by Top Tier Legal PLLC.</p>

				<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;">9. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-stone-600">We may update this policy periodically. The latest version will always be available on our website with the effective date. For significant changes, we will notify you by email or through a notice on our website.</p>

				<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;">10. Contact Us</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-stone-600">If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, contact us at:</p>
				<p class="mt-4 text-stone-700">
					Top Tier Legal PLLC<br />
					Phone: (845) 596-0430<br />
					Email: <a href="mailto:clientcare@toptierlegalpllc.com" class="hover:underline">clientcare@toptierlegalpllc.com</a>
				</p>
				<p class="mt-6 text-stone-600">By using our website and services, you consent to this Privacy Policy.</p>

				<p class="mt-10 text-sm text-stone-500">
					<a href="/toptierlegal/sms" class="hover:underline">SMS Program</a> · <a href="/toptierlegal/terms" class="hover:underline">Terms of Service</a>
				</p>
			</div>
		</article>
	</main>
	<TopTierLegalFooter />
</TopTierLegalLayout>
